  <item>
    <title>106.事缓则圆，拉长时间慢慢来，答案自会浮现</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fbd77359699d74dc75c992</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fbd77359699d74dc75c992</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Apr 2025 15:30:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>园姐之前的文章讲过一个六字箴言：不贪不急不比。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最近，终于深深体会了「不急」是什么意思。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👀时间戳：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 慢慢来比较快，曾经就是一句口号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 反馈的出现，需要时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 为什么可视化的任务管理如此有有用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 怎么才能度过没有反馈的时间，坚持做完一件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 当所有声音都在追求快的时候，一定要找到自己的地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 耐心，在决策中同样重要 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="739">12:19</a> 如果不想重复被恶心，在讨厌的事情上耐心也很重要</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🏃‍♀️扫码加入「听友群」和「鹅鹅小卖铺」</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhs3I_fov_gSYsYpK5ppxAhwpkHE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
