  <item>
    <title>105.人活一口气，别把心气弄丢了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f264e8f9578163d64e26a3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f264e8f9578163d64e26a3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Apr 2025 11:30:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🥟标题是上周下班路上突然弹进我脑子里的，当时明显感觉到自己的状态恢复，就是心气又回来的感觉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以这期节目聊一聊对我恢复心气很重要的两件事，以及如果你也正处于没心气的状态， 该怎么找回能量~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>👀时间戳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 你现在是什么情况🎤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 绷着的弦突然断了之后，发现断了好像也没事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="309">05:09</a> 意外之喜，我开起了“小卖铺”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> &nbsp;没赚到钱，但超级开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 心气的丢失，是自我和环境负反馈的叠加</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 你要接受，心气的复苏也是一个过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> 减轻社媒用量，关闭负面信息摄入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 不要钻牛角尖，去和真实的人聊天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> “曲线救国”在别的事情上先找到手感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🏃‍♀️「小卖铺」和「听友群」都开放喔！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>扫码加微信进群~</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhs3I_fov_gSYsYpK5ppxAhwpkHE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
